    "updated_at": "2020-04-24T15:01:38Z",
    "body": "Well the existing ones are registered I believe so there is some place to find more information about them. If we kept our own registry that would be okay as well, but having strings without any additional information seems bad as only git blame would give you something.\r\n\r\nIt's not so much about the formalities to me as it is about where to find more information.",
